            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "5.16.21 I’ve never had a Gin Daisy before but thought this turned out very well. I don’t care for super sweet drinks, so I did reduce the amount of simple syrup, and for our personal taste, the level of sweetness was spot on. Good contrast of sweet-tart between the lime juice and the grenadine and simple syrup. I sip on wine mostly these days but do enjoy an occasional cocktail, and this was a good one.",
